 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd\n14 King Street, BS1 5TR Bristol, United Kingdom\nVAT No: GB444431791\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\n\nFROM\n\nThamesview Logistics Ltd\n14 King Street\nBS1 5TR Bristol\nUnited Kingdom\nVAT: GB444431791\n\nPAID [circled]\nBILL TO\nWestbrook Pharma Ltd\n221 Baker Street\nM1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 18/01/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Thamesview\nLogistics Ltd, with its registered office at 14 King Street, Bristol (\"Party A\"), and Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at 221\nBaker Street, Manchester (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Thamesview Logistics Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nParty B    Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Amelia Clarke\nDate       18/01/2026",
